            "line": 177,
            "text": "theorem norm_le_iff {k : ℕ} (f : CK (E := E) k) {B : ℝ} (hB : 0 ≤ B) :\n    ‖f‖ ≤ B ↔ ∀ n ≤ k, ∀ x : I, ‖iteratedDerivWithin n (extend (f.val 0)) I x‖ ≤ B"
